---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import Layout from "../Layout/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Sabin Panta">
	<section id="intro" class="intro">
		<div class="profile-block">
			<img
				src="/photo.jpg"
				alt="Sabin Panta"
				class="profile-photo"
				width="150"
				height="150"
			/>
			<div class="contact-icons">
				<a href="mailto:sabin.panta@usu.edu" aria-label="Email">
					<Icon name="mdi:email-outline" />
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/s-panta/"
					aria-label="LinkedIn"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener"
				>
					<Icon name="simple-icons:linkedin" />
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/s-panta"
					aria-label="GitHub"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener"
				>
					<Icon name="simple-icons:github" />
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="intro-text">
			<p>
				I am currently doing my Masters at Utah State University in
				Civil and Environmental Engineering with an emphasis on
				Intelligent Water Systems.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="research" class="row">
		<h2>Research</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				My current research focuses on using MQTT communication protocol
				to environmental sensor nodes for smarter sensor networks. The
				word smarter is quite relative and subjective here.
			</li>
			<li>
				Further I am exploring how these MQTT deployed sensor nodes can
				do Adaptive Sampling and as a result achieve Situational
				Awareness.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section id="experience" class="row">
		<h2>Experience</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Software Developer - 2 years</li>
			<li>Civil Engineer - 2.5 years</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section id="projects" class="row">
		<h2>Projects</h2>
		<ul>
			<!-- <li>Project one</li>
			<li>Project two</li> -->
		</ul>
	</section>

	<p class="quote">
		If you don't fail at least 90 percent of the time, you're not aiming
		high enough. - Alan Kay
	</p>
</Layout>
